# The Gobbiebag Part IX (jeuno 123): Lower Jeuno's Bluffnix (no script; default 43 with 81), the template
# GobbiebagQuest. A level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 5 ((650 + 0 + 0) / 2 = 325), the inventory at 70 (storage; a
# fresh char has 30), Parts I-VIII completed (the chain's earlier parts, by a GM), the four items, a Bowl of Goblin Stew
# (880) and a Chocobo Feather. Available: a trade: no trade handler; 43 (71, 0, 1), option 1: nothing; option 0: begun.
# Accepted: 43 (71, 1, 1), its finish: no handler; three items, the four and the feather, the stew and an item: 43 (71,
# 1, 1); the stew alone: 73 (76), the quest completed by a GM while it is open: no 73 finish (the stew kept); accepted
# again (a GM): the four items: 73 (76), finished: completed, the inventory 75, INVENTORY_INCREASED, the items taken (no
# satchel: unchanged). Completed: Part X's 43 (76, 0, 1) (its fame level 5 met, the inventory 75, Part IX completed),
# declined (option 1). Set accepted by a GM at 75: the accepted check fails: no section (43 (81)), a trade: nothing; set
# available by a GM at 75: no section. A GM sets a part available before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it
# completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/73
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
storage inventory 70                    # the part's start size (char_storage.inventory; a fresh char has 30)
fame Sandoria 650
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartV completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii completed
item OrichalcumIngot
item SquareOfPeisteLeather
item SquareOfOilSoakedCloth
item OxbloodOrb
item BowlOfGoblinStew880
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Bluffnix ChocoboFeather x1        # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # reqsMet: 43 (71, 0, 1)
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # 43 (71, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted: 43 (71, 1, 1)
finish option=0                         # no 43 finish while accepted: nothing
trade Bluffnix OrichalcumIngot x1 SquareOfPeisteLeather x1 SquareOfOilSoakedCloth x1 # three of the four: 43 (71, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix OrichalcumIngot x1 SquareOfPeisteLeather x1 SquareOfOilSoakedCloth x1 OxbloodOrb x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: 43 (71, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1 OrichalcumIngot x1 # the stew and an item: 43 (71, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1   # the stew alone: 73 (76)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx completed # a GM, while 73 is open
finish                                  # no 73 finish while completed: nothing (the stew kept)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx accepted # a GM
trade Bluffnix OrichalcumIngot x1 SquareOfPeisteLeather x1 SquareOfOilSoakedCloth x1 OxbloodOrb x1 # the four items: 73 (76)
finish                                  # completed; inventory 75; INVENTORY_INCREASED; the items taken
trigger Bluffnix                        # completed: Part X's 43 (76, 0, 1)
finish option=1                         # declined: nothing
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx accepted # a GM, at 75
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the inventory 75: no section; 43 (81)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1   # no section: nothing
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIx available # a GM, at 75
trigger Bluffnix                        # available, the inventory 75: no section; 43 (81)
finish option=0                         # no section: not begun
